8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"separate_consent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pipia\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"evidenceLevel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优先级与动作清单\">优先级与动作清单</h3><p>三处设计要点。第一，<code>priority</code> 数值越小优先级越高，豁免类规必须排在阈值判定之后而非之前——否则第 5 条的人头豁免会把本该走评估的场景提前拦下。第二，<code>prerequisites</code> 是<strong>动作清单</strong>而不是标签，它直接驱动后续两章的流程实例化：<code>tia</code> 与 <code>pipia</code> 会各创建一条评估工单，<code>scc_module_selection</code> 会触发 <a href=\"../tia-dpia-workflow/importer-obligation-verification\">接收方义务与安全核验</a> 里的角色判定。第三，<code>evidenceLevel</code> 决定第四章留痕的粒度——走充分性认定的链路只需记录认定编号，走 SCC 的链路需要留存完整评估与合同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"求交-多规则命中时取最严\">求交：多规则命中时取最严</h3><h3 id=\"求交-多规则命中时取最严\">求交：多规则命中时取最严</h3><p>一次出境命中多条规则是常态。求交的语义必须是<strong>取并集的约束、取最强的机制</strong>，而不是取优先级最高的一条就结束——因为优先级只在一个法域内部有效，跨法域之间没有优先级关系，只有同时满足。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 机制强度: 数值越大要求越高, 用于求交时取 max&#10;CREATE TABLE mechanism_strength (&#10;  mechanism  TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  strength   SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  requires_regulator_action BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE&#10;);&#10;&#10;WITH hits AS (&#10;  SELECT r.mechanism, s.strength, s.requires_regulator_action,&#10;         r.prerequisites, r.evidence_level&#10;  FROM transfer_rule r&#10;  JOIN mechanism_strength s ON s.mechanism = r.mechanism&#10;  WHERE r.exporter_cc = $1&#10;    AND (r.importer_cc = $2 OR r.importer_cc = &#39;*&#39;)&#10;    AND $3 = ANY(r.categories)&#10;    AND (r.priority IS NULL OR r.valid_from &lt;= now())&#10;)&#10;SELECT array_agg(DISTINCT hits.mechanism)                       AS mechanisms,&#10;       max(hits.strength)                                       AS binding_strength,&#10;       bool_or(hits.requires_regulator_action)                  AS needs_regulator,&#10;       array_agg(DISTINCT p)                                    AS all_prerequisites&#10;FROM hits, unnest(hits.prerequisites) AS p;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 机制强度: 数值越大要求越高, 用于求交时取 max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mechanism_strength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mechanism  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  strength   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requires_regulator_action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">strength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">requires_regulator_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prerequisites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transfer_rule r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mechanism_strength s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exporter_cc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_cc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_cc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">categories</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mechanisms,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">strength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binding_strength,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       bool_or(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">requires_regulator_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needs_regulator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> all_prerequisites</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits, unnest(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prerequisites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>binding_strength</code> 取 <code>max</code> 意味着：只要有一条路径要求安全评估，整个出境就必须走评估，哪怕另一条路径只要求记录认定编号。这正是「保护水平不下降」原则在多法域场景下的机械表达——不同法域的保护目标可能不同，但企业只能执行一个动作，因此必须执行其中最严的那个。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前提动作的传递闭包\">前提动作的传递闭包</h3><p>求交得到的不只是机制，还有一份前提动作清单。这份清单需要展开成传递闭包才能驱动流程，因为有些动作依赖另一些动作的输出：<code>scc_module_selection</code> 依赖接收方角色判定结果，而角色判定又依赖清单里该链路的字段使用方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"expand_prerequisites(seeds):&#10;  queue = list(seeds); seen = set(); out = []&#10;  while queue:&#10;    a = queue.pop()&#10;    if a in seen: continue&#10;    seen.add(a); out.append(a)&#10;    queue.extend(prereq_graph[a])       # prereq_graph[a] = a 的直接前置动作&#10;  return topological_sort(out)          # 保证可执行顺序\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>expand_prerequisites(seeds):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  queue = list(seeds); seen = set(); out = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while queue:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a = queue.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if a in seen: continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    seen.add(a); out.append(a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    queue.extend(prereq_graph[a])       # prereq_graph[a] = a 的直接前置动作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return topological_sort(out)          # 保证可执行顺序</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把依赖关系做成图而不是硬编码顺序，好处是新增一类动作只需插入一条边。工程上这一步的价值在第三章会体现得很直接：评估工单的创建顺序若与依赖相反（先签约后评估），系统会在最需要评估结论的签约环节拿不到输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冲突收敛-同一批数据受两地管辖\">冲突收敛：同一批数据受两地管辖</h2><h3 id=\"五种冲突形态与收敛规则\">五种冲突形态与收敛规则</h3><p>最棘手的情形是出发地规则与目的地规则都对同一批数据提出要求，而两者的要求不可同时满足。典型案例是从欧盟向中国传输：欧盟侧要求做 TIA 并证明目的地法律不会实质削弱保护，中国侧要求在做安全评估时把范围、规模、目的写死在评估结果里且不得超出。两种要求并不矛盾但会相互加强——一份合格的安全评估结果恰好能为 TIA 的「目的地法律影响」一节提供材料。</p>\n<p>真正的冲突出现在<strong>数据类别判定不一致</strong>时：同一份字段在欧盟可能只是普通个人数据，在中国却可能因聚合规模被认定为重要数据；或某个字段在中国属于敏感个人信息（如行踪轨迹），在欧盟侧从字段本身看只是普通个人数据。收敛规则应当是<strong>按最严分类处理</strong>，而不是按出发地分类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突形态</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>收敛规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分类不一致</td>\n<td>一方认定敏感/重要，另一方不认定</td>\n<td>按最严分类，全链路按该分类处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机制不同</td>\n<td>一方要求评估，另一方只需合同</td>\n<td>取最强机制，副作用是前提动作并集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时限不同</td>\n<td>一方要求 10 个工作日备案，另一方无要求</td>\n<td>取最短时限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留期冲突</td>\n<td>一方要求删除，另一方要求留存</td>\n<td>取更短保留期，并在合同中写明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的地判定</td>\n<td>一方有充分性认定但接收方不在范围内</td>\n<td>视同无认定，回退到第 46 条通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是 <a href=\"scc-bcr-adequacy-eu\">欧盟 SCC/BCR/充分性认定</a> 中「判定粒度是接收方实体」这条结论的直接应用：矩阵里的 <code>importerInAdequacyScope</code> 必须是一个由接收方清单驱动的字段，而不能简化为国家代码匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本化与再判定\">版本化与再判定</h3><p>矩阵本身会变：充分性认定可能被废止或暂停、阈值可能被调整、自贸区负面清单可能更新。前者的时间尺度是法律性的——第 45(3) 条要求每一项充分性认定都包含至少每四年一次的定期审查机制，且委员会在保护水平不再足够时可以<strong>不具追溯效力</strong>地废止、修订或暂停该决定（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-45-gdpr/\">Article 45 GDPR</a>）。因此矩阵必须版本化，且每条出境绑定记录要保存<strong>判定当时的矩阵版本</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE transfer_rule (&#10;  rule_id      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  matrix_version TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  priority     SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  exporter_cc  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  importer_cc  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  categories   TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  mechanism    TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES mechanism_strength(mechanism),&#10;  prerequisites TEXT[] NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  evidence_level TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_from   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to     DATE&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE transfer_decision (&#10;  transfer_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  matrix_version TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  matched_rules  TEXT[] NOT NULL,      -- 求交时命中的全部规则, 供审计&#10;  binding_mechanism TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  prerequisites  TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  decided_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transfer_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  matrix_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exporter_cc  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importer_cc  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  categories   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mechanism    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mechanism_strength(mechanism),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prerequisites </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transfer_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transfer_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  matrix_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  matched_rules  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 求交时命中的全部规则, 供审计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  binding_mechanism </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prerequisites  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保存 <code>matched_rules</code> 而不只保存最终机制，是为了让审计能够解释「为什么当时选了这条通道」。当监管问询「你依据什么认为可以走充分性认定」时，答案是一份可复现的规则匹配记录，而不是一位已离职同事的判断。矩阵版本变更后，可以用一次离线比对找出所有「按新版本需要升级机制」的历史绑定，把它们排进复核队列——这比等到下次检查时被动发现要便宜得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>机制矩阵是一张<strong>查找表</strong>：四个判定维度（出发地、目的地、数据类别、主体属性）覆盖多数法域规则。</li>\n<li>一次出境通常命中<strong>多条规则</strong>，输出应是机制集合；求交语义是「取最强机制 + 前提动作并集」。</li>\n<li>前提动作需要展开为<strong>传递闭包并按拓扑排序</strong>，否则流程实例化顺序会与依赖相反。</li>\n<li>跨法域冲突用「取最严」收敛：最严分类、最强机制、最短时限、更短保留期；目的地判定必须精确到<strong>接收方实体</strong>。</li>\n<li>矩阵必须<strong>版本化</strong>，且每次判定都要保存命中的全部规则，使合规结论可复现、可解释。</li>\n<li>第二章 <a href=\"../outbound-data-inventory/crossborder-data-flow-map\">跨境数据流图与字段清单</a> 为这张矩阵提供判定输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多法域传输机制矩阵配置","id":"多法域传输机制矩阵配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：矩阵是查找表而非判断逻辑","id":"核心概念-矩阵是查找表而非判断逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"规则表结构与匹配语义","id":"规则表结构与匹配语义"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级与动作清单","id":"优先级与动作清单"},{"level":3,"text":"求交：多规则命中时取最严","id":"求交-多规则命中时取最严"},{"level":3,"text":"求交：多规则命中时取最严","id":"求交-多规则命中时取最严"},{"level":3,"text":"前提动作的传递闭包","id":"前提动作的传递闭包"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突收敛：同一批数据受两地管辖","id":"冲突收敛-同一批数据受两地管辖"},{"level":3,"text":"五种冲突形态与收敛规则","id":"五种冲突形态与收敛规则"},{"level":3,"text":"版本化与再判定","id":"版本化与再判定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中国出境安全评估、标准合同与认证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-mechanism-config/china-outbound-security-scc"},"next":{"title":"跨境数据流图与字段清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/outbound-data-inventory/crossborder-data-flow-map"}}